{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-09-09T16:15:43.449Z","tool_id":"update_topic__call_1373447","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Campaign Successfully Completed**\n\n**Summary:**\nWe have successfully completed our research campaign. We analyzed the SN50 miner and identified key performance bottlenecks in volatility lookback and non-Gaussian shock modeling. Through systematic parallel sweeps, we proved that cryptocurrencies benefit from a full 7-day lookback and moderate Student-t tails (df=4.0 for 1h, df=7.0 for 24h), while equities and commodities benefit from a short 1-day lookback and heavy-tailed Student-t shocks (df=3.0). Combining these into a dynamic routing model achieved outstanding CRPS improvements (up to 7.0% on SP500). All deliverables (journal, report, suggestions, and CHAMPION) have been committed and the harness interface check has passed with 'ok'.\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Complete research campaign and nominate finalized champion model."}
